		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Six-legged, filthy stork that implants eggs in victims.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +2 (1d4) and 1 claw +2 (grab) or implant, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. Lay eggs inside grabbed or helpless mortal. One week after implanting, CON 15+ or 2d4 CON damage as 1d4 hatchling gryphs burst from stomach. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
